      "properties": {
        "enabled": true,
        "locked": true,
        "style": "transparent",
        "text": "There is no index and no retrieval step. An answer is computed in one forward pass from billions of weights that encode statistical regularities of the training data, so facts seen often come back well and facts seen rarely are reconstructed — with the same fluent cadence either way.\n\nIf it has to be right, put the source in the context and say so.",
